# Whenever an Angel you control dies, create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying (CR 700.4, 603.10a). One Wrath of God
# kills Bot1's Bishop, two Segovian Angels, a Savannah Lions (white, not an Angel) and Bot2's Segovian Angel together: the Bishop,
# dying at the same time, looks back and triggers once for each of Bot1's two Angels (ruling 2019-07-12) - two tokens, none for
# the Lions (not an Angel) or Bot2's Angel (not under Bot1's control). The Bishop is not an Angel itself.

